**`app/main.py`** — added filtering, pagination, and CRUD endpoints:
- `GET /tasks` now accepts `status`, `priority`, `assigned_to` (all optional, combinable) and `page`/`page_size` with defaults of 1 and 20.
- `POST /tasks` requires auth via `Depends(require_api_key)`, validates `project_id` against `projects` (404 if missing), auto-generates the next unique integer ID, and returns the created task with status 201.
- `PUT /tasks/{task_id}` requires auth, applies partial updates from `TaskUpdate`, and returns 404 if the task doesn't exist.
- `DELETE /tasks/{task_id}` requires auth, removes the task, and returns 404 if not found.

